{'symbol': 'SIVB', 'date': '2021-05-12 08:00:00', 'title': 'SVB FINANCIAL GROUP ANNOUNCES FULL-RIDE UNDERGRADUATE UNIVERSITY SCHOLARSHIP PROGRAM', 'text': "SANTA CLARA, CALIF., MAY 12, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0SVB FINANCIAL GROUP\xa0(SVB), PARENT COMPANY OF SILICON VALLEY BANK, THE BANK OF THE WORLD'S MOST INNOVATIVE COMPANIES AND THEIR INVESTORS,\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED A NEW UNIVERSITY SCHOLARSHIP PROGRAM, WHICH WILL FUND APPROXIMATELY 25 FULL-RIDE SCHOLARSHIPS."}